  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tema_PortoDaTemporada
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Popula\xE7\xE3o flutuante"
  _titleEn: Floating population
  _category: 2
  _unlockTrigger: 12
  _summary: "Popula\xE7\xE3o flutuante \xE9 quem n\xE3o mora na cidade, mas usa a
    \xE1gua, o esgoto, as ruas e o hospital dela durante a temporada. A rede precisa
    dar conta do pico e fica ociosa no resto do ano."
  _summaryEn: The floating population is made up of people who do not live in a city
    but use its water, sewers, streets and hospital during the season. The network
    must handle the peak and sits idle the rest of the year.
  _realWorld: "No ver\xE3o de 2023 para 2024, a falta de \xE1gua chegou a durar cerca
    de uma semana em pontos do litoral paulista. Em Bertioga, 40,9% da popula\xE7\xE3o
    vivia sem coleta de esgoto."
  _realWorldEn: "In the summer of 2023 to 2024, water outages lasted about a week
    in parts of the S\xE3o Paulo coast. In Bertioga, 40.9% of residents had no sewage
    collection."
  _tradeOffs: "Dimensionar a rede para o pico custa caro o ano inteiro; dimensionar
    para a m\xE9dia falha justo na alta temporada."
  _tradeOffsEn: Sizing the network for the peak is costly all year; sizing it for
    the average fails right in high season.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Gazeta do Povo, falta de \xE1gua no litoral (2024)"
    Url: https://www.gazetadopovo.com.br/sao-paulo/turismo-alta-temperatura-expoem-falta-planejamento-investimento-rede-abastecimento/
  - Label: "Alesp, abastecimento no litoral no ver\xE3o (2012)"
    Url: https://www.saopaulo.sp.leg.br/blog/galeria-de-audios/sabesp-intensifica-acoes-para-garantir-abastecimento-no-litoral-neste-verao/
